      "lines": [
        "д) $(5x+3)^2=5x+3$；",
        "е) $(5x+3)^2=(3x+5)^2$；",
        "ж) $(4x+5)^2=4(x+5)^2$；",
        "з) $(2x+10)^2=4(x+5)^2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1004",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1004. 解下列方程并进行检验：",
        "а) $x^2-2x-5=0$； б) $x^2+4x+1=0$；",
        "в) $3y^2-4y-2=0$； г) $5y^2-7y+1=0$；",
        "д) $2y^2+11y+10=0$； е) $4z^2-9z-2=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1005",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1005. 求下列方程的根的近似值，精确到0.01：",
        "а) $x^2-2x-2=0$； б) $x^2+5x+3=0$；",
        "в) $3x^2-7x+3=0$； г) $5x^2+31x+20=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1006",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1006. $a$是什么数时，方程$ax^2-3x-5=0$的一个根等于1？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1007",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1007. 证明方程$ax^2-(a+c)x+c=0$的一个根等于1。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1008",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1008. 已知方程$ax^2+bx+c=0$的一个根：а) 等于$-1$，",
        "б) 等于$\\frac{c}{a}$（$c\\neq0$），求这个方程的系数之间的关系。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1009",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1009. 已知下列方程有唯一的根，求参数$a$取值的集合：",
        "а) $4x^2+28x+a=0$； б) $25x^2+ax+16=0$；",
        "в) $ax^2+28x+4=0$； г) $x^2+ax+114=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1010",
      "box": null,
